an><br/><br/><span class=\"strong\"> Tanya</span>:  A strange young woman came into the coffee shop. She looks like she's been through a war!  Her hair is a mess and her jeans are torn. She has been sitting near me for a few minutes now drinking coffee. She's just been staring into space.", "id": 1}, {"time": "13500", "image": "engenn9le05ob06re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> James</span>:  Has she been mugged? Is she in shock? Has anyone called the police? What have the other people in the cafe been doing?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\"> Tanya</span>:  Everyone here has been ignoring her - like it's normal. She's covered in mud. How could that have happened? It hasn't been raining. The streets are dry!<br/><span class=\"strong\"> James</span>:   Have you tried to talk to her? If she hasn't been calling anyone herself maybe she's lost her phone!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\"> Tanya</span>:  Going over there now ... lol\n<br/><span class=\"strong\"> James</span>:  ???", "id": 2}, {"time": "40500", "image": "engenn9le05ob06re2img03.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Tanya</span>:  You won't believe it! I said I didn't mean to be nosy, but she looked like she's had a really bad day. Did she need help? She looked up at me and laughed. I recognized her immediately and felt so stupid!!! It was Nadia Travenski!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\"> James</span>:  NO WAY!<br/><span class=\"strong\"> Tanya</span>:  They're shooting an action movie in the building next door. She thought she would just hide out in here for a little break. She thanked me for my concern. When she finished, she paid her bill and mine.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\"> James</span>:  Did you get her autograph?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Tanya</span> : She's just come in again with the director ...  going to be an extra in the next scene!!!! Later ...", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}